WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.776
Far from Earth, a small world is counting on you.

00:00:03.776 --> 00:00:07.552
Welcome to Mission Dhruva.

00:00:07.552 --> 00:00:11.328
An adventure where curiosity keeps a Mars outpost alive.

00:00:12.328 --> 00:00:16.162
This is more than a journey through screens.

00:00:16.162 --> 00:00:19.996
You are the scientist.

00:00:19.996 --> 00:00:23.830
Explore four connected systems.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.664
Make predictions, run experiments, and discover why every decision matters.

00:00:28.664 --> 00:00:32.000
Start with a fixed supply of energy.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.336
Give more power to the greenhouse, and another system must receive less.

00:00:35.336 --> 00:00:38.672
Test your plan.

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:42.008
The choices you make here will shape the storm ahead.

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:46.555
Choose a crop.

00:00:46.555 --> 00:00:50.102
Study its needs.

00:00:50.102 --> 00:00:53.650
With six units of water and three growing cycles, experiment with what helps it thrive.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:57.197
More water cannot replace missing light.

00:00:57.197 --> 00:01:00.744
Every harvest tells a story.

00:01:01.744 --> 00:01:04.365
When the storm arrives, there is no countdown.

00:01:04.365 --> 00:01:06.986
Read the situation.

00:01:06.986 --> 00:01:09.606
Compare the consequences.

00:01:09.606 --> 00:01:12.227
Protect your crew, your harvest, or the research.

00:01:12.227 --> 00:01:14.848
Your preparation changes the outcome.

00:01:15.848 --> 00:01:19.304
The mission ends with understanding.

00:01:19.304 --> 00:01:22.760
Reflect on your decisions, then bring the same scientific thinking back to your garden, your classroom, and your world.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:26.216
Mission Dhruva.

00:01:26.216 --> 00:01:29.672
Created by Anthahkarana.
